<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts steady, some $0.50 higher. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-3    220-260 lbs    58.25-58.50,</p>
<p>60 head fairly uniform 59.00 US 2-3    260-280 lbs    57.25-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. 1.00-1.50 lower. Top 55.00. US 1-3    350-450 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-700 lbs    53.00-55.00</p>
</text>
